{"skill":{"slug":"mailchimp","displayName":"mailchimp"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790938778123,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":63801,"sha256":"975df495f179a14fdb46fa76e91318c8f1d284744f4cb21e4aecda092b5190a7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2008,"sha256":"b6d6892adb367cde903fec53d01a2aa29d153d06ba61a6864f177750f2878f9a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790963179569,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"21437f775b6e85ef0881cd718ef9667f1c381aef595a13bb31995f4d3ebfe382","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/21437f775b6e85ef0881cd718ef9667f1c381aef595a13bb31995f4d3ebfe382","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790939209091},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790963179569},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This Mailchimp skill is a disclosed Maton gateway integration with high-impact marketing actions that require user approval, and I found no hidden code or deceptive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Bash/network/OAuth access is proportionate for a Mailchimp API gateway skill, and the raw HTTP API-key path is documented as a fallback only when the CLI cannot be used.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses a pinned Maton CLI via npm or Homebrew and requires network access plus a Maton account; the artifact itself contains Markdown documentation only and no executable files.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read/list calls, require explicit approval for connection creation and all writes, and place additional approval/scoping requirements around functions, triggers, destinations, and local --exec handling.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth refresh tokens are stored in the OS credential store, and hosted functions/triggers/destinations can persist, but these behaviors are disclosed with approval, least-privilege, cleanup, and credential-handling guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's Mailchimp API access, subscriber management, campaign operations, reports, hosted functions, and trigger automation are coherent with its stated email-marketing purpose; high-impact actions such as sending campaigns are explicitly called out.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable using Maton as the gateway to your Mailchimp account. Review every write, campaign send, function deploy, trigger, or destination before approving it, because these can change subscriber data, send real email, or create ongoing automation. Prefer the CLI/OAuth flow over raw API keys, and delete unused connections, functions, triggers, and destinations when finished.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790963179569}}}}}